/// Term 3 ("Multiplication and Division Facts") of the Year 4
/// Mathematics pathway. Week 9 builds up the harder multiplication tables
/// (6/7/8/9/11/12) from known facts via near-fact addition, doubling, and
/// near-ten adjustment, plus the commutative property; Week 10 introduces
/// multiplying a 2-digit number by a 1-digit number via partitioning
/// (tens part + ones part, recombined); Week 11 introduces division as
/// the inverse of multiplication and division with remainders, grounded
