/// Term 4 ("Measurement: Length, Mass, and Capacity") of the Year 4
/// Mathematics pathway -- a breadth strand breaking up the arithmetic
/// focus of Terms 1-3, the same way Year 1's own Term 4 ("Measures")
/// broke up its arithmetic terms. Week 13 covers length (mm/cm/m/km,
/// converting between adjacent units, reading a ruler to the nearest mm);
/// Week 14 covers mass (g/kg, converting between them, reading a scale to
/// a labelled division); Week 15 covers capacity (ml/l, converting
/// between them) and perimeter of rectangles and simple rectilinear
/// (L-shaped) figures; Week 16 closes the term with a capstone -- a
/// single "Nova School Garden Project" scenario requiring length, mass,
